# Runtime image allowlist. Keep the first rule broad so new repository paths do
# not silently enter the remote builder context or the final COPY layer.
**

# Git metadata is excluded explicitly as a reviewable security invariant.
.git
.git/**

# Package metadata and license material needed by the image build.
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

# Runtime code and the one in-image entrypoint.
!src
!src/**
!scripts
!scripts/container-entrypoint.sh
